REQ["Admitted model-backed Job"]:::compute
PROV["Provision disposable worker"]:::compute
BOOT["Boot pinned Reverend runtime image"]:::compute
MAN["ModelArtifactManifest<br/>approved source • immutable revision • files • hashes"]:::model
CACHE{"Verified worker-local<br/>ephemeral snapshot?"}:::data
UP["Approved upstream repository<br/>exact pinned revision"]:::data
STAGE["Staging download<br/>bounded retries/timeouts"]:::compute
VERIFY["Verify revision / files / safe format / digests"]:::verify
ATOM["Atomic verified snapshot"]:::data
LOAD["Load model runtime"]:::model
SMOKE["Functional smoke health"]:::verify
READY["Node/Profile READY"]:::compute
RUN["Grant inference lease"]:::compute
TERM["Worker terminated<br/>cache may disappear"]:::compute

REQ --> PROV --> BOOT --> MAN --> CACHE
CACHE -->|yes| LOAD
CACHE -->|no| UP --> STAGE --> VERIFY --> ATOM --> LOAD
LOAD --> SMOKE --> READY --> RUN
RUN --> TERM

FAIL["Hydration failure<br/>block / bounded retry / release paid worker"]:::security
STAGE -->|source/timeout failure| FAIL
VERIFY -->|mismatch| FAIL

METRIC["Hydration telemetry<br/>bytes • seconds • source • startup cost"]:::cost
STAGE --> METRIC
LOAD --> METRIC

ECON["Cache economics<br/>monthly hydration cost vs recurring storage"]:::cost
METRIC --> ECON
RECO["Persistent cache recommendation<br/>operator approval required"]:::cost
ECON --> RECO

LOCAL["Developer local copies<br/>optional archival only<br/>not normal hydration source"]:::data
LOCAL -. no production dependency .-> MAN
